{"book":"hono","chapter":"helpers","chapterTitle":"المساعدات","slug":"html","title":"مساعد `html`","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"html","text":"html"},{"depth":3,"id":"إدراج-المقتطفات-في-jsx","text":"إدراج المقتطفات في JSX"},{"depth":3,"id":"العمل-كمكون-وظيفي","text":"العمل كمكوّن وظيفي"},{"depth":3,"id":"يستقبل-الخصائص-ويضمن-القيم","text":"يستقبل الخصائص ويضمّن القيم"},{"depth":2,"id":"raw","text":"raw()"},{"depth":2,"id":"نصائح","text":"نصائح"}],"html":"<p>تتيح لك الأداة المساعدة html كتابة HTML داخل قالب نصي JavaScript (template literal) باستخدام وسم باسم <code>html</code>. باستخدام <code>raw()</code>، سيتم عرض المحتوى كما هو. عليك تهريب (escape) هذه السلاسل النصية بنفسك.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { html, raw } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/html&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"html\"><code>html</code></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:username&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { username } = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    html`<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!doctype <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hello! </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${username}</span><span class=\"language-xml\">!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>`</span>\n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"إدراج-المقتطفات-في-jsx\">إدراج المقتطفات في JSX</h3>\n<p>أدرِج السكربت المضمّن (inline script) في JSX:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(\n    \n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>Test Site<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n        {html`\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// No need to use dangerouslySetInnerHTML.</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// If you write it here, it will not be escaped.</span>\n          </span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n        `}\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span>\n      <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>Hello!<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span>\n    \n  )\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"العمل-كمكون-وظيفي\">العمل كمكوّن وظيفي</h3>\n<p>منذ <code>html</code> يعيد HtmlEscapedString، ويمكنه العمل كمكوّن كامل الوظائف دون استخدام JSX.</p>\n<h4>استخدم <code>html</code> لتسريع العملية بدلًا من <code>memo</code></h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Footer</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) =&gt; html`<span class=\"language-xml\">\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">address</span>&gt;</span>My Address...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">address</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>&gt;</span>\n`</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"يستقبل-الخصائص-ويضمن-القيم\">يستقبل الخصائص ويضمّن القيم</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">SiteData</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">description</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">image</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">children</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Layout</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">SiteData</span></span>) =&gt; html`<span class=\"language-xml\">\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">charset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.title}</span><span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;description&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.description}</span><span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">prefix</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;og: http://ogp.me/ns#&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">property</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;og:type&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;article&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- More elements slow down JSX, but not template literals. --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">property</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;og:title&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.title}</span><span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">property</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;og:image&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">content</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;</span></span></span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.image}</span><span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\"><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n  </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${props.children}</span><span class=\"language-xml\">\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span>\n\n`</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Content</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">props</span>: { siteData: SiteData; name: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }</span>) =&gt; (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Layout</span> {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props.siteData</span>}&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Hello {props.name}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">Layout</span>&gt;</span></span>\n)\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> props = {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;World&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">siteData</span>: {\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello &lt;&gt; World&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">description</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;This is a description&#x27;</span>,\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">image</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://example.com/image.png&#x27;</span>,\n    },\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Content</span> {<span class=\"hljs-attr\">...props</span>} /&gt;</span></span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"raw\"><code>raw()</code></h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> name = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;John &amp;quot;Johnny&amp;quot; Smith&#x27;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">html</span>(html`<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>I&#x27;m </span><span class=\"hljs-subst\">${raw(name)}</span><span class=\"language-xml\">.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>`</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"نصائح\">نصائح</h2>\n<p>بفضل هذه المكتبات، يفسر Visual Studio Code و vim أيضًا القوالب الحرفية (template literals) كـ HTML، مما يسمح بتطبيق تلوين بناء الجملة (syntax highlighting) والتنسيق.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=bierner.lit-html\">https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=bierner.lit-html</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MaxMEllon/vim-jsx-pretty\">https://github.com/MaxMEllon/vim-jsx-pretty</a></li>\n</ul>\n"}